Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想跟别的猎人合作  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want another hunter, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙叫啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思  有啥情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Garth, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好把这事儿告诉联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better drop a dime to the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你会高点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I thought you'd be taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个瘦皮猴是干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what's with the scrawny guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,临时搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威利斯  联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willis. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  盖思  不是打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Garth, not me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是打给真正的联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}the FBI. The real FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马默杜克  真够疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Marmaduke, you're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么活到现在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都错过什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前  就在这片树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long ago, in these very woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住着一个老妇人  名字叫做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lived an old woman by the name...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮·格林奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Jenny Greentree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:01:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全家死于火灾后  她无家可归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forced out after her family was killed in a fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}she lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至有人说她已经失去人性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say, even her humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太凄惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真人真事  雷  看呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a true story, Ray. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在死前把姓名首字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}She carved her initials into that tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刻在了那棵树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}right before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是她的姓名首字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are not her initials.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how'd she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一晚  一场暴风雪袭来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night... a blizzard hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.69,0:01:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她又饥又冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cold. She's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:27.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有地方去  没有人帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere to go. No one to turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮·格林奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny Greentree froze to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那棵树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}right beneath...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活活冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那之后  她的恶灵就一直在这片树林里游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her evil spirit has haunted these woods ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真该看看你们的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys should have seen your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么  特雷弗  一点都不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Trevor? That's not funny, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得超搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开车来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo did you drive here, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样  不如你拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, why-- why don't you take--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿我的电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}take my phone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:17.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向老爸打小报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Dad and bust me, why don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我的意思是  你喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm just saying, you're wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不能开车  -一堆废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't just drive-- - Blah, blah, blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:22.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  特雷弗  我们坐下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. Trevor, let's just sit down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你没听见那声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You-- you don't hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特雷弗  什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor, there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  我们坐下来吧  然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Let's just sit down, and we'll all just--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to run. You got to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  不过你弟弟在嗑什么药啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but what is your brother on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:02:59.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特雷  别闹了  别那么讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trev, come on. Stop being a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  特雷  我们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Trev. Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:29.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么样  飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, top gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:04:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  希望你们放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, i'd like a little respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  警官  我们没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, officer. We didn't realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅你们  坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All's forgiven. Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我那晚在寡妇岭特雷弗·麦凯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about Trevor McAnn. Other night up at Widow's Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当时很怪  -一开始他好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was weird...  - Well, at first it was just like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他喝得烂醉  -他喝得烂醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- cause he was super-drunk. - he was super-drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是詹妮·格林奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Jenny Greentree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那不过是个愚蠢的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? She's just a dumb legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  谁  -詹妮·格林奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold up. Who? - Jenny Greentree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸说她真的在森林里丧命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad says she really died in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被安葬在镇上的墓园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's buried in the town cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  詹妮·格\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Jenny G.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休想再害人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ganking days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被盖思秒杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been Garthed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷  你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在该和家人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be with your family right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  别做傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything stupid. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞定了  怨鬼安息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I clocked out. Put it to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要上你那去  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm headed your way, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浴缸里放好热水\N{\fnArial\fs30}fire up that hot tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  我更爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I heart you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在寡妇岭发现被弃车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandoned vehicle out by Widow's Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又发现一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we got another body up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这人被撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's torn to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧  怎么可能  我秒杀她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. How is that possible? I garthed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果他醒了或是别的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, call us if he wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, you know, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:06:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.43,0:07:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮忙  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for your help, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡没有好转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Cass is the same, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, down to the drool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你的脑袋怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, how is your custard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺好  越来越好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. It's getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望别像《午夜凶铃》那盘录像带似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wish it wasn't like the damn tape from "The ring."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事是因为把疯狂传给别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I feel like I'm okay 'cause I passed on the crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的  你听到小卡怎么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't. You heard what Cass said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就别说了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's -- let's not. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩  我是盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean. It's Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等下  你是谁  -盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. W-who is this? - Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思·菲茨杰拉德四世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth Fitzgerald iv.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前合作杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked together on that demon thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你怎么样  盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how you doing, Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我需要你来帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to cash in that chip, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堪萨斯章克申城出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something brewing in Junction city, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们  这就是布朗下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen... this is Corporal Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯·布朗下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal James Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正要去玛亚纳空军报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shipping off to the A.F. Mayana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来悼念我的堂弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to pay respects to my cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我没法出席他的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I will not be able to attend the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你家人来说打击一定很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be terrible for your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接连失去两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing two brothers so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的  我姑姑  她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. My aunt -- she's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为此心都碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's real broken up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生  我们能看看两人案卷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, doc, can we see both files, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太太  我就在办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my wife. I'll, uh, be in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没说他们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say they were brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我才知道又死人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I just found out about the other corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想快点行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...started moving quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在四处打探呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sucking up info as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛  你对西装过敏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you allergic to a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我只是穿军装更好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I just... look good in a uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  死因相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Same cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  夜里在森林里被人剖腹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, uh, gutted at night in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说詹妮·格林奇的鬼魂在那里游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}where legend says that the ghost of Jenny Greentree roams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我检测过电磁波了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, I already scanned for EM...F.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我的可能又坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess mine must be broken again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我信你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm reading your mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-詹妮什么的鬼魂  -格林奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, ghost of Jenny...whatever? - Greentree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题就在这儿  我烧了她的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just it. I torched her bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她还有什么东西留存下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, maybe she's got something still laying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深表怀疑  她当时无家可归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highly doubtful. Chick was homeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说难道只有我觉得这不像恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, is it me, or is this less evil spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是怪物咬死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}more monster chow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过目击者称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the witness said
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追杀第一个死者的东西是隐形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that whatever was chasing victim numero uno was invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐形鬼魂狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh so, invisible ghost werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我为什么要叫你们来支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you think I called for backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们听说过高乐麦芽酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you ever heard of Thighslapper Ale?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是脱衣女郎还是什么饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a stripper or a beverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二逼货喝的饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverage for douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太平洋西北部销量第一的微酿啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, number one microbrew in the Pacific Northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们在堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're in Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不说了  你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I rest my case. What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这老板是死去两兄弟的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The owner is the Dad to the dead brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.87,0:09:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我换下军装  扮上联调局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll can the uniform, go Fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四十分钟后啤酒厂见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you at the brewery in 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他的好感是慢热型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grows on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探员们  我叫玛丽  是这里的经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents. I'm Marie. I'm a manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你能在周日赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming in on a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意帮忙  什么事都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to help. Anything we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是你爸的产业吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. So all this is your dad's, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他朋友  兰迪·巴克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his friend-- Randy Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:20.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在共有这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they own the place together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh..."now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是戴尔死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, since Dale died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  等下  等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们以为我想多晚来就多晚来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I just come in late whenever I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  先生  不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir. It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是"魅力十足"的兰迪·巴克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, "Charming" Randy Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜  你现在得值夜班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You're headed for the graveyard shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟到一秒钟  你就可以滚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be one second late, and you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他其实是很不错的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's actually a really nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是管事的都不容易啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just not easy being the axman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同事会跟你谈  我就失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My comrades got you covered, so if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦凯先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McAnn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会占用你很久  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we'll be brief. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦凯先生  你两个儿子会不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McAnn, is there any reason to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}your sons may have had enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是被动物袭击了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were told they were animal attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是需要调查所有的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to explore every possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.91,0:11:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有很多朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们和你一起在这里工作吗  像玛丽一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do they work here with you? Like Marie does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会有人嫉妒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could someone have been jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  只有玛丽在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no. Marie's the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个  没有  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay -- no. Th-- there's no...uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆  没事的  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他休息一下  我来回答你们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him get some rest. I'll answer your questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔死时他就很自责  现在又出了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He blamed himself when Dale died, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he blame himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔比较敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dale was sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你也不能时时刻刻盯着他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do you do -- watch them 24/7?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不能怪戴尔的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't blame Dale's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你爸爸还是自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your dad still feels bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔妻子起诉我们使得情况更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it doesn't help Dale's wife is suing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:53.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很生气很悲伤  这又是在美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's angry and grieving, and this is America?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很了解雷和特雷弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Ray and Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是吉姆四个孩子的教父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'm godfather to all four of Jim's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷和特雷弗很喜欢寻乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray and Trevor loved their fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们从不做什么疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they'd never do anything crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己没儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No regrets of your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆的孩子就像我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just jim's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:12.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会借我的车  扫荡我的冰箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd borrow my car, raid my fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩和第三个合伙人合办这家公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the two of you started this company with a third partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.15,0:12:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对的  戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他几个月前去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He passed away a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在森林里去世还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passed away in the woods or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有问题不是一天两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he had problems for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is just a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始是戴尔  现在又是这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Dale, now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这本该是我们最重要的一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was gonna be our big year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要出售高乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're selling Thighslapper
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卖给美国最大的分销商之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}to one of the largest distributors in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经谈了几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been in the works for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新闻很快就要公布于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}News is gonna hit public pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人生的终极目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the brass ring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  要不是现在这个情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given other circumstances, yeah, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会庆祝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd be celebrating right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很棒  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks great, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在家吗  -外公来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - There's grandpa. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿些点心  你应该吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get some snacks. You should eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在画什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}My world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lillian!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上出来活动的有爪怪物数都数不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a million things with claws go bump in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦加上"隐形"二字  数字就变少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you throw in "Invisible," the number goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"午后偷欢"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Afternoon delights"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得这地方有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think this place is a little, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办工一天后  谁不想泡个热水澡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you want a nice hot tub after a day at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小事罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真为这酒厂的兄弟感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel sad for those brewery dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花费一生利用啤酒来美化世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend your life beautifying the world through beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先是合伙人自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}First a partner offs himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后是两个孩子被不知名怪物抓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now two kids get ganked by unknown freakadeek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这上面说  戴尔不仅仅是合伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, Dale wasn't just a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是个酿酒专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was also the brewmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:35.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酿酒专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Brewmaster"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是公认的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was widely considered a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么微酿啤酒也配不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No microbrew is worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么来着  八本美食杂志大奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what was it -- eight food magazine awards?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒不是食品  它是  水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer's not food. It's...whatever water is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thighslapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这酒真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that's actually awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我都不生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I'm not even mad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开怀畅饮啊  盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party on, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我通常不喝啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even usually drink beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会影响我的深度知觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It messes with my depth perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是我裸泳的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when I skinny-dip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想听笑话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys want to hear a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  有件事很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this. This is something interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思  你醉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth, are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我刚刚喝完了一整瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I just... drank a whole beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么有意思的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Something interesting."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能再来点高乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I have some more Thighslapper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:17:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  -不行  你只能喝咖啡美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No. Coffee for you, Tara Reid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱尔兰咖啡行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee with ---- in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这上面说实际上戴尔在死前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it says that Dale actually left the company
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两周就离开了公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}two weeks before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许  因为不想出售而被赶走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...maybe he got pushed out 'cause he didn't want to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯特说交易已经谈了数月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Baxter said the deal's been in the works for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就说明了那个遗孀为何要起诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain the widow. She's suing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许戴尔对此不满  而且怨气依旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Dale had a bone to pick, and he's still picking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  也许他阴魂不散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So, maybe he's a spirito Malo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各警队速到麦凯宅邸  沃什伯恩698号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit to McAnn residence. 698 Washburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"麦凯的宅邸"  是吉姆·麦凯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"McAnn residence," as in Jim McAnn?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看在他们的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in, let's hope for their sake
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们的幽灵没离开森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}our spirito ain't made it out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩去吧  我去拜访下那个遗孀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you two go. I'm gonna visit the widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么样  -这地方没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - Place is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的电磁感应器什么都没有  这个也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My EMF is a nada. So is this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是我的吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that mine? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我借来一用  以防我的坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I borrowed it in case mine's broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找的还是隐形狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still on invisible werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是  也许不是  我没法让苔丝开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, maybe not. I can't get Tess to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我感觉她看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I get the feeling she saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去和她谈一轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take a run at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一轮  -相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A what? - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的特别女士有个双胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My special lady has twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦凯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McAnn?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"特别女士"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Special lady."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让我们单独和苔丝谈一会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we speak to Tess alone for just a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会很有帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would really help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在那边  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.57,0:18:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  苔丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想告诉我今晚看见什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me what you saw tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你想和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you'll talk to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费佐先生谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Mr. Fizzles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思  把袜子放一边去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth. Why don't we put the sock away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费佐先生想要帮助苔丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fizzles wants to help Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费佐要去不见天日的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fizzles is gonna go where the sun don't shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苔丝  我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它有爪子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it have claws?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苔丝  为什么你是唯一能看见的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you were the only one that could see it, Tess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么呢  苔丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else, Tess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为费佐先生能看出来你在\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause Mr. Fizzles can sense when you're being a...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}...liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's -- that's enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费佐先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fizzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.30,0:19:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喝了大人的饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drank a grown-up drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大人的  咖啡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, grown-up like, uh, coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you mean alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让他们逮捕我  费佐先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them arrest me, Mr. Fizzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你丈夫去过很多地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband did a lot of traveling, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.31,0:20:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为找最好的配料他去了国外许多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to all kinds of exotic places for the best ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喝过他酿的酒  非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I've tried his work. It's -- it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.21,0:20:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你跟戴尔以前的合伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I hear you're not exactly on the best of terms
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Dale's old partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们背着他出售了他的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they sold his company right out from under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了钱  是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about money. It's about...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒厂就像他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was his baby, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像对此挺生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound pretty upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我气死了  恨死他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm furious. I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而我又想到了戴尔是个怎样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I think how Dale was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的朋友们抛弃了他  你知道他怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}His friends left him behind, but you know what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:34.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我要送他们一件礼物以示我对他们的宽恕"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm gonna send them a gift that shows I forgive them".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他送了他们什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what he sent them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一瓶日本米酒  他旅游时带回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottle of saki. From one of his trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装在一个上面有手写字的华丽盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a...gorgeous box with writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对这东西可小心了  连我都不让碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so careful with it. Wouldn't let me touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树林里那个孩子看到了别人看不到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, kid in the woods sees something that nobody else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后苔丝看到了一个怪物  而吉姆没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Tess sees a monster, and Jim doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.95,0:20:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些变种人能看到红外线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, certain mutants see infrared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:08.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"大人的饮料"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Grown-up drinks".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苔丝喝了妈妈的酒  而第一个死者也喝得烂醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tess chugged her mom's, and vic number one was plastered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  也就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得喝醉才能看到怪物  好酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Monster you got to be drunk to see. Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  也很难消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also... hard to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.67,0:21:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是热热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just getting in the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只能喝果酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are strictly on wine coolers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢果酒  我就喜欢甜的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I love those. Anything sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个难看的酒瓶是怎么回事  幸运符吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what's with the grody flask anyway? Lucky charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是鲍比的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bobby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么微酿啤酒也配不上  什么来着  八本...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No microbrew is worth-- what was it-- eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得有没有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there's a possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鲍比在扰乱你的电磁场信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Bobby's riding your wave?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  我们把他火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we gave him a hunter's wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我烧了我表弟布兰登的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I burned my cousin Brandon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他还是在人世游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he stayed stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有还有  印度也有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And-- and-- and they got ghosts in India,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们所有人都是火葬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they cremate everybody over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.79,0:22:14.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是直觉  不过也许这里的确有电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just instinct, but maybe there is EMF around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但与这案子无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just ain't the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.49,0:22:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  别谈论这个了  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're not gonna talk about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在工作时说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the middle of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.47,0:22:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是希望火化烧到位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hope that fire did the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  知道了  我们就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Got it. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.40,0:23:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人一直在偷酒喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been sampling the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.63,0:23:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.51,0:23:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  我爱死偏执狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I love paranoid people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.40,0:23:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你能不能登上电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  第一起死亡是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, first death was, what,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四个月前  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}four months ago? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.47,0:23:46.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  特雷弗·麦凯  第一个死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm, and, uh, Trevor Mcann. Patient zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.31,0:23:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底从那瓶子里放出什么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did he let out of that bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.86,0:24:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.72,0:24:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能喝醉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, can you even get drunk anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.46,0:24:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说喝酒就和喝维生素一样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like drinking a vitamin for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.81,0:24:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  开始吧  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Party time. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.43,0:24:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒带再放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rewind and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把这东西放出了盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he-- he let that thing out of the box,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它肯定是跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it must have just followed him
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去那个闹鬼的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the place with all the thingies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.90,0:25:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是高招\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.53,0:25:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还真有点醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually kind of drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.43,0:25:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:26.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me likey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真怀念这么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss these talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.58,0:25:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕  关掉它  快关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Turn it off. Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.43,0:25:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还联邦探员呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI, huh? You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.13,0:25:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们跟警察扯淡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can save it for the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.69,0:25:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯特先生  听我说  请你听我们解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Baxter, listen. If you just let us explain, you might...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.64,0:25:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,911  有什么紧急情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}911. What's your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.09,0:25:52.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Do you need assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.75,0:25:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Anata ga marou mono...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.15,0:26:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}wa anata ka ra mo morau".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说"我将夺走你们从我这儿夺走的东西"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "What you took will be taken from you".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.12,0:26:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多就是以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, eye for an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.15,0:26:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听得懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.09,0:26:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Kono bin niwa
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}syoujou zuke no sake ga hu-in sarete iru".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.46,0:26:20.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西你们到底是哪里弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you guys get this anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.53,0:26:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Is there, uh, something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不迷信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not superstitious, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-完全不  -不迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not at all. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.34,0:26:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这上面说里面的瓶子里有个酒仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because... this says the bottle inside contains a Shojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.73,0:26:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒仙是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a... Shojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.35,0:26:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}An alcohol spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.23,0:26:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是个古老的神话  换了我不会担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's just an old myth. I wouldn't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.71,0:26:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是这东西可不太友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they are not known for being friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Uh, hey... there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -谢谢  保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. Yeah. - Thank you. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.48,0:27:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Baxter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.78,0:27:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  这家伙可比看上去要重得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude's a lot heavier than he looks, F.Y.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.38,0:27:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.62,0:27:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你会想要回这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you might want this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.28,0:27:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你塞住全美最二逼的微酿啤酒执行总裁的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the C.E.O. of the douchiest microbrew in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.40,0:27:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他放在你的浴缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}gagged in your hot tub?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.72,0:27:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这会有好下场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think that's gonna end well?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们太不有爱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not feeling the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:25.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  酒仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Shojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.71,0:27:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能查到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, let's see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.58,0:27:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒仙是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Shojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.78,0:27:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日本酒怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Japanese booze monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.00,0:27:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概这就是喝醉才能看到它的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that would explain why you got to be drunk to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.31,0:27:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有诗意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.06,0:27:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好怕怕哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.75,0:27:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  上面说酒仙在有很多酒的地方游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, a Shojo is said to roam where there's lots of alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.37,0:27:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,民间传说  在过去的日本\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's lore saying that, back in the old day,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.52,0:27:51.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你醉得厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you were plastered enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.55,0:27:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能看到一个酒仙躲藏在酿酒厂附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could see one skulking around the breweries in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.56,0:27:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这个为什么要撕了酿酒商的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why is this one shredding brewers' kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.65,0:27:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以用正确的咒语盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, you can harness the will of a Shojo
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.15,0:28:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来控制酒仙的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the right spell box.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.70,0:28:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你基本上就有了一条攻击犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you basically have an attack dog
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.25,0:28:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以帮你完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you can sic on whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你任何的复仇任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}sort of personal revenge mission you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以戴尔弄了一个来惩罚他的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Dale nabs one to punish his pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.20,0:28:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送去这个瓶子  早晚都有人要打开喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the bottle, sooner or later it's popped open.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.05,0:28:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就有了一个酒仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have a Shojo
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.36,0:28:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会做任何戴尔写在这个盒子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will do whatever Dale compelled it to do
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.21,0:28:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强迫它做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here on the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.57,0:28:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.22,0:28:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它杀的不是背叛了戴尔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except it's not killing the people that screwed him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.94,0:28:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔的妻子说  公司就是他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dale's widow said the company was his baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他真想让朋友们感受他所感受的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if he really wanted his friends to feel what he felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.25,0:28:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就会夺走他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would take theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.90,0:28:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的孩子  至少是吉姆的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, their kids. Jim's, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.51,0:28:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯特是他们的教父\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Baxter was the godfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.91,0:28:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  直接说我们怎么对付它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, skip to how do we gank it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.02,0:28:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好消息  它是可以消灭的  -但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good news. It is killable. - But...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.10,0:28:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只能用受到日本神道教赐福的武士刀杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only with a samurai sword consecrated with a Shinto blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是什么好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...that's not a silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒仙早就已经把该杀的都杀了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shojo already cleaned house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽是最后一个还活着的目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Marie's the last target standing, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.92,0:28:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去当铺  找找看那把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the pawn shops and, uh, look for the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.46,0:28:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去盯着玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You babysit Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.40,0:28:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.05,0:28:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I've got nothing to be sorry for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.39,0:28:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.39,0:29:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心鲍比也许一直跟着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm concerned that Bobby might be haunting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和迪恩说过  他不让我再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought it up to Dean, and he shot me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.37,0:29:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth! Leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.23,0:29:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没事  -不  有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - No, it's far from okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.43,0:29:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已试过和鲍比联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already tried contacting Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.37,0:29:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那瓶酒凭空消失了  我就用了碟仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that beer disappeared, I pulled out a talking board.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.76,0:29:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不叫上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时想  何必拉你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I figured, why drag you in...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.01,0:29:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我自己也能做好这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's something I could just put to bed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.25,0:29:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.24,0:29:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在的话  我就会告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he was there, I'd have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.49,0:29:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚点再说  你跟着玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about this later. You follow Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的钥匙借我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me borrow your keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.29,0:29:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想帮你的  巴克斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to help you, Mr. Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.76,0:29:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.93,0:29:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我很疑惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.25,0:29:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔戳中了你们的痛处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale goes to get you all where it hurts--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.94,0:30:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过  你没有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only, you don't have any kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.81,0:30:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是伤我很深  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It still affects me. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.38,0:30:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在隐瞒什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me what you're hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.18,0:30:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.95,0:30:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.33,0:30:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上次给员工三次机会是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you gave an employee three chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可能从未有过  -正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Probably never. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是管事的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the axman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.80,0:30:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这活儿不好干  但是总得有人做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough job, but, hey, somebody's gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.99,0:30:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么给那个懒鬼清洁工多次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how come you cut that slacker janitor so many breaks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.26,0:30:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I--I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.38,0:30:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我搜索过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, I googled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果发现了他妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to find his mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很早之前是你的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}was your secretary way back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.67,0:30:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦  你当时已婚了  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you were married to Mrs. B., so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.52,0:30:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定没干出格的事  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way there's anything naughty there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要怎样才肯说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.41,0:30:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管戴尔知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what Dale knows about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面四处杀孩子的鬼可知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that thing out there killing the kids -- it knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.78,0:31:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他妈妈并不是和平分手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't end well with his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.34,0:31:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要我发誓永远不告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made me swear never to tell him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这秘密守不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.76,0:31:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.84,0:31:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他啊  他在啤酒厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh -- he's at the brewery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.50,0:31:13.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上晚班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working the graveyard shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.45,0:31:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还有那么一丝关心那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you care about that kid at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.84,0:31:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别叫警察来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't call the cops on me just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.74,0:31:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说  最好在流水下做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says it's best to do this in a running spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.60,0:31:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好  有水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. I, uh -- I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.49,0:31:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We good?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.41,0:31:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.89,0:32:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shichihukujin..."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.83,0:32:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.93,0:32:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hito no teni rori korekara
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.49,0:32:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[日语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seitoun yakuwari wo hatasu kono ken wo tataer."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.03,0:32:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.55,0:32:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  谢谢你  给\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Uh, thanks. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.15,0:32:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.02,0:32:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  巴克斯特有个私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Baxter's got a secret love child!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个酒仙可能会先去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shojo might come for him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是要救人命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save lives here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.33,0:32:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喝醉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.20,0:32:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.75,0:32:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把手机掉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dropped the phone, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.70,0:32:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.69,0:32:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.37,0:32:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起对不起  我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry, sorry. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.20,0:32:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:32:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在啤酒厂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the brewery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.00,0:33:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.08,0:33:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  它在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.41,0:33:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂喂  你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, hey! What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.79,0:33:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想活命就跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me if you want to live! 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.64,0:33:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.41,0:33:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you good to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.08,0:33:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搭车  那鬼东西在啤酒厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get a ride. It's at the brewery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.94,0:33:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个孩子  别想了  赶紧出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another kid. Don't think -- move.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.55,0:34:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.78,0:34:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出租车  喂喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi! Hey, hey, hey! Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.20,0:34:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下  等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.43,0:34:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国家安全大事  请让让\N{\fnArial\fs30}National security! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.91,0:34:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您  女士  添麻烦了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, ma'am. Sorry. Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.27,0:34:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  去啤酒厂  赶紧出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Brewery. Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.35,0:34:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒厂  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brewery! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.20,0:34:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快点行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry. Hurry, hurry. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.66,0:34:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  但我喜欢慢慢开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, but I like to drive safe, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.13,0:34:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  这是怎么啦  你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what's going on? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.56,0:34:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是执法人员  孩子  跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the law, son. Now, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是醉了  老兄  滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you drunk, dude?! Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.89,0:34:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我直说了  巴克斯特是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll just shoot. Baxter is your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.79,0:34:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯特背叛了戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baxter screwed Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔套住了一个只有在醉酒后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale roped this Japanese monster
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.91,0:34:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能看得见的日本鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can only see when you're drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.24,0:34:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在它来杀你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.59,0:34:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  巴克斯特是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, wait a minute. Baxter is my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在看哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.35,0:34:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.57,0:34:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  那儿什么都没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, there's nothing there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.99,0:35:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们得赶紧出去  老兄  有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get out of here, man. It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.35,0:35:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁  -盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who?! - Garth!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.29,0:35:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个家伙被砸昏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a guy -- he got knocked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.03,0:35:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.62,0:35:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-站在我身后  快  -好好好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay behind me. Stay behind me. - Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.19,0:35:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你看得见它\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you can see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.71,0:35:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我现在喝醉了  你就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm skunked. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.80,0:35:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-消防出口  数到三  好不  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire exit. On three. All right? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.24,0:35:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  换个法子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So much for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.79,0:35:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.40,0:36:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-它在哪儿  -往右边砍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it?! - S-swing right!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.46,0:36:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.96,0:36:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三点方向  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 o'clock, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}6 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.12,0:36:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.63,0:36:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.98,0:36:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吗  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.31,0:36:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他  他在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's -- he's over this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.22,0:36:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你能去把他弄来吗  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you go get him? - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都错过什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.80,0:37:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿自己移动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.15,0:37:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.02,0:37:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊  现身啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.46,0:37:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的不想一起去逛逛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you guys don't want to hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.45,0:37:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃顿早午餐  或许喝点啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab some brunch, maybe some brews?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.18,0:37:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很诱人  但我们得滚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tempting but, uh, we better roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.23,0:37:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.05,0:38:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.92,0:38:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.78,0:38:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -还有你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - And, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.83,0:38:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.27,0:38:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.59,0:38:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.90,0:38:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.58,0:38:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了  朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sayonara, kemo sabes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.97,0:38:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.73,0:38:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.96,0:38:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实是慢热型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has grown on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.29,0:38:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  咱们来谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Um... so, let's talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.00,0:38:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.07,0:38:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说碟仙的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. The, uh, talking board?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.60,0:38:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的  我想我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine. I get it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.98,0:38:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.66,0:38:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听见你说的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.70,0:38:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.59,0:38:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒厂里发生什么了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in the brewery, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.21,0:38:58.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  只是我的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. It was, uh -- it was just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.76,0:39:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.21,0:39:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.07,0:39:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能对我坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to be straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.30,0:39:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把剑从屋子另一边飞到我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade was across the room, and then it was in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.39,0:39:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我的酒自己没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then my beer drank itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.24,0:39:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  那页书奇迹般的出现在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and then, that page magically appeared on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.98,0:39:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  鲍比的书自己掉了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and then Bobby's book feel down,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到小卡那人的号码自动掉了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and out popped the number of the guy who found Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.58,0:39:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我确定没啥事  -显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing, I'm sure. - Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.91,0:39:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好  你什么意思  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.66,0:39:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底鲍比在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is bobby here or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.13,0:39:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我在想什么吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.82,0:39:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得即使普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that regular people,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.59,0:39:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能到处看到死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they see ones they lost everywhere, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.05,0:39:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那叫鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Freaking ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.50,0:39:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者只是因为他们太想念那些人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they just miss them a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.94,0:39:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在人群中看到死去之人的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they see a face in the crowd --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.12,0:39:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们则看到书从桌子上掉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see a book falling off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.12,0:39:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一样的  迪恩  我试过碟仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing, Dean. I mean, I did the talking board.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.26,0:39:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做过多次电磁测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran plenty of EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.79,0:39:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒消失时  我有点傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that beer went poof, I went a little nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.05,0:39:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那你怎么没告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.04,0:39:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  那会儿都傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, little nuts at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.48,0:39:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, if it wasn't Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.53,0:39:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么玩意儿把剑送到我手里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what Jedi'd that sword into my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个酒仙在屋子对面就能关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shojo slammed the door from across the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.47,0:39:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许它也想去抓那把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was trying to grab the sword, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.69,0:40:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.30,0:40:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  如果那是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, I mean, if it was Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.18,0:40:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会让我们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.77,0:40:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁还能比鲍比更懂得做鬼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who knows more about being a ghost than Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.61,0:40:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上会跟我们搞《人鬼情未了》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instant Swayze, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.30,0:40:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.55,0:40:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.26,0:40:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是  我们好不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so your theory is that -- that we're practically
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.84,0:40:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做了回普通人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}regular people about something for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.36,0:40:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.31,0:40:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想吃顿早午饭  喝点啤酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you want to grab some brunch and some brews?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.44,0:40:30.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不要了  我还醉着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, no. I'm so hung over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还是赶紧上路吧  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's just hit the road. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.39,0:40:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.82,0:41:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里呢  你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here, you idjit!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.44,0:41:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
